manifest"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வென்றோய்","parts":[{"text":"வென்றோய்","lemma":"வென்றோய்","gloss":"O victor!"}],"gloss":"O victor!","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நின்னினும்","parts":[{"text":"நின்","lemma":"நீ","gloss":"you"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"comparative suffix"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"even"}],"gloss":"even more than you"},{"surface":"நல்லன்","parts":[{"text":"நல்","lemma":"நன்மை","gloss":"good"},{"text":"அன்","lemma":"அன்","gloss":"masculine singular suffix"}],"gloss":"he is a better man"},{"surface":"அன்றே","parts":[{"text":"அன்று","lemma":"அன்று","gloss":"is it not"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis particle"}],"gloss":"indeed / is he not?"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கலிகொள்","parts":[{"text":"கலி","lemma":"கலி","gloss":"bustle"},{"text":"கொள்","lemma":"கொள்","gloss":"possess"}],"gloss":"bustling"},{"surface":"யாணர்","parts":[{"text":"யாணர்","lemma":"யாணர்","gloss":"new wealth"}],"gloss":"prosperous"},{"surface":"வெண்ணி","parts":[{"text":"வெண்ணி","lemma":"வெண்ணி","gloss":"Venni (place name)"}],"gloss":"Venni"},{"surface":"பறந்தலை","parts":[{"text":"பறந்தலை","lemma":"பறந்தலை","gloss":"battlefield"}],"gloss":"battlefield"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மிக","parts":[{"text":"மிகு","lemma":"மிகு","gloss":"exceed"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"infinitive suffix"}],"gloss":"greatly"},{"surface":"புகழ்","parts":[{"text":"புகழ்","lemma":"புகழ்","gloss":"fame"}],"gloss":"fame"},{"surface":"உலகம்","parts":[{"text":"உலகம்","lemma":"உலகம்","gloss":"world"}],"gloss":"world"},{"surface":"எய்தி","parts":[{"text":"எய்து","lemma":"எய்து","gloss":"reach"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"இ","gloss":"past participle suffix"}],"gloss":"having attained"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"புறப்புண்","parts":[{"text":"புறப்புண்","lemma":"புறப்புண்","gloss":"wound on the back"}],"gloss":"wound on the back","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நாணி","parts":[{"text":"நாண்","lemma":"நாண்","gloss":"be ashamed"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"இ","gloss":"past participle suffix"}],"gloss":"having felt ashamed"},{"surface":"வடக்கு","parts":[{"text":"வடக்கு","lemma":"வடக்கு","gloss":"north"}],"gloss":"north"},{"surface":"இருந்தோனே","parts":[{"text":"இருந்தோனே","lemma":"இருந்தோனே","gloss":"he who sat (fasting to death)"}],"gloss":"he who sat (fasting to death)","split_unverified":true}]}],"literal":"Sailing ships on the vast, great ocean, / O descendant of the strong ancestor who commanded the action of the wind! / O Karikal Valavan with elephants of rutting nature! / Having gone and conquered in battle, so that your strength was manifest, / O victor! He is indeed better than you, / on the bustling, prosperous battlefield of Venni, / having attained a world of great fame, / he who sat facing north, ashamed of the wound on his back.","translation":"O descendant of the strong one who commanded the wind's action to sail ships on the vast, deep ocean! O Karikāl Vaḷava, who possesses elephants of rutting nature! O victor, who went and conquered in battle so that your great strength was made manifest! He is indeed greater than you—the one who, on the bustling and prosperous battlefield of Veṇṇi, felt ashamed of the wound on his back and sat facing north, fasting to death, thereby attaining a world of supreme fame.","modern":"பரந்த பெரிய கடலில் கப்பல்களைச் செலுத்தி, காற்றின் இயக்கத்தைக் கட்டுப்படுத்தி ஆண்ட வலிமைமிக்க முன்னோனின் வழித்தோன்றலே! மதம் பிடித்த இயல்பைக் கொண்ட யானைகளை உடைய கரிகால் வளவனே! போர்க்களத்திற்குச் சென்று போரிட்டு வென்று உன்னுடைய வலிமை வெளிப்படுமாறு செய்த வெற்றியாளனே! ஆரவாரம் மிக்க, புதிய வளங்களைக் கொண்ட வெண்ணிப் பறந்தலையில் (போர்க்களத்தில்), தன் முதுகில் பட்ட காயத்திற்காக நாணி, வடக்கு நோக்கி உயிர் துறக்க அமர்ந்தானே, அவன் உன்னை விடவும் நல்லவன் (சிறந்தவன்) அல்லவா? அவன் உலகப் புகழை அடைந்துவிட்டான்.","explanation":"The poet Veṇṇik Kuyattiyār addresses the Chola king Karikāl Peruvaḷattāṉ after his victory at the battle of Veṇṇi. While she praises Karikālaṉ's illustrious lineage of seafaring ancestors who mastered the winds and his immense military strength, she boldly declares that the defeated Chera king, Perum Cēral Ātaṉ, is even greater. The Chera king, having received a wound on his back during the battle, felt deeply ashamed of this mark of dishonor. Consequently, he chose to perform 'vaṭakkiruttal' (fasting to death facing north) to reclaim his honor, thereby attaining eternal fame. This poem belongs to the 'vākai' tiṇai (victory), specifically 'araca vākai', but it beautifully subverts the praise of physical victory by highlighting the supreme moral victory of the defeated king.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.9],[0.9,1.1],[1.1,1.6],[1.6,2.7],[2.7,2.7],[2.7,3.0],[3.0,3.5],[3.5,4.6],[4.6,4.8],[4.8,4.9],[4.9,5.3],[5.3,5.7],[5.7,6.3],[6.3,6.7],[6.7,6.8],[6.8,7.1],[7.1,7.2],[7.2,7.8],[7.8,9.0],[9.0,9.0],[9.0,9.8],[9.8,9.9],[9.9,11.0],[11.0,11.2],[11.2,11.6],[11.6,12.4],[12.4,13.2],[13.2,13.5],[13.5,13.6],[13.6,14.4],[14.4,15.2],[15.2,15.2],[15.2,15.4],[15.4,16.3]],"female":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,1.0],[1.0,1.2],[1.2,1.7],[1.7,2.9],[2.9,3.0],[3.0,3.3],[3.3,3.8],[3.8,3.8],[3.8,5.4],[5.4,5.9],[5.9,6.1],[6.1,6.5],[6.5,7.7],[7.7,8.3],[8.3,8.5],[8.5,8.8],[8.8,9.0],[9.0,9.6],[9.6,10.9],[10.9,11.0],[11.0,11.8],[11.8,11.9],[11.9,12.9],[12.9,13.1],[13.1,13.5],[13.5,14.3],[14.3,15.3],[15.3,15.5],[15.5,15.6],[15.6,16.52],[16.52,17.5],[17.5,17.5],[17.5,17.73],[17.73,18.6]]},"sync":[[["நளி","vast"],["இரு","great"]],[["முந்நீர்","ocean"]],[["நாவாய்","ship"]],[["ஓட்டி","having steered"]],[["வளி","wind"],["தொழில்","action"]],[["ஆண்ட","who ruled"]],[["உரவோன்","strong man"]],[["மருக","O descendant!"]],[["களி","rutting"]],[["இயல்","having the nature of"]],[["யானை","elephant"],["கரிகால்","Karikal"]],[["கரிகால்","Karikal"]],[["வளவ","O Chola king!"]],[["சென்று","having gone"]],[["அமர்","battle"]],[["கடந்த","who conquered"]],[["நின்","your"]],[["ஆற்றல்","strength"]],[["தோன்ற","to be manifest"]],[["வென்றோய்","O victor!"]],[["நின்னினும்","even more than you"]],[["நல்லன்","he is a better man"]],[["அன்றே","indeed / is he not?"]],[["கலிகொள்","bustling"]],[["யாணர்","prosperous"]],[["வெண்ணி","Venni"],["பறந்தலை","battlefield"]],[["பறந்தலை","battlefield"]],[["மிக","greatly"]],[["புகழ்","fame"]],[["உலகம்","world"]],[["எய்தி","having attained"]],[["புறப்புண்","wound on the back"]],[["நாணி","having felt ashamed"]],[["வடக்கு","north"]],[["வடக்கு","north"],["இருந்தோனே","he who sat (fasting to death)"]]]}